{
  "uid": "kit-estado",
  "title": "Estado del kit",
  "tags": [
    "kit"
  ],
  "description": "Qué funciona y qué no en el kit, de un vistazo.",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Problemas ahora",
      "description": "Alertas activas en este momento. 0 es lo normal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "Ninguno",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Equipos",
      "description": "Encendido quiere decir que el equipo responde desde kit01.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 20,
        "h": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(up{job=\"node\",equipo=\"kit01\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "kit01 (router y servidor)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(up{job=\"node\",equipo=\"clinica01\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "clinica01",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(up{job=\"node\",equipo=\"comunidad01\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "comunidad01",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{job=\"sonda_icmp\",equipo=\"sw01\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Switch (sw01)",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{job=\"sonda_icmp\",equipo=\"ap01\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Wi-Fi (ap01)",
          "refId": "E",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Encendido",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "No responde",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Servicios",
      "description": "Cada servicio se prueba desde kit01 en IPv4 y en IPv6. Si falla cualquiera de las dos, sale en rojo y el detalle está en la tabla de abajo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"pacientes\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Historia clínica (DHIS2)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"registro\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Registro de pacientes",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"consultas\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Consulta de prerregistros",
          "refId": "K",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"biblioteca\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Biblioteca",
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"videos\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Videos",
          "refId": "L",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"portal\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Portal de la Comunidad",
          "refId": "M",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"smb\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Archivos compartidos",
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"ldaps\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Inicio de sesión (AD)",
          "refId": "E",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"postgresql\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Base de datos",
          "refId": "F",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{job=\"sonda_dns\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Nombres de la red (DNS)",
          "refId": "G",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(node_systemd_unit_state{equipo=\"kit01\",name=~\"kea-dhcp4-server.service|kea-dhcp6-server.service|radvd.service\",state=\"active\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Direcciones de la red (DHCP)",
          "refId": "H",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(node_systemd_unit_state{equipo=\"kit01\",name=\"chrony.service\",state=\"active\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Hora del kit (NTP)",
          "refId": "I",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(min(probe_success{servicio=\"ssh\"})) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "Acceso de administración (SSH)",
          "refId": "J",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "1": {
                  "text": "Funciona",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "0": {
                  "text": "No funciona",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "unit": "none",
          "noValue": "Sin datos",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Qué está fallando",
      "description": "Vacía cuando todo funciona. Red indica si falla en IPv4 o en IPv6.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "ALERTS{alertstate=\"firing\"}",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Value": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "alertstate": true,
              "job": true,
              "severidad": true,
              "type": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "alertname": 0,
              "servicio": 1,
              "name": 2,
              "mountpoint": 3,
              "equipo": 4,
              "familia": 5,
              "consulta": 6,
              "instance": 7
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "alertname": "Problema",
              "servicio": "Servicio",
              "name": "Programa",
              "mountpoint": "Disco",
              "equipo": "Equipo",
              "familia": "Red",
              "consulta": "Consulta DNS",
              "instance": "Dirección probada"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Todo funciona"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Problema"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "ServicioCaido": {
                        "text": "Un servicio no responde",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "UnidadFallida": {
                        "text": "Un programa se detuvo con error",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 1
                      },
                      "ExporterCaido": {
                        "text": "Un equipo no envía datos",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 2
                      },
                      "DiscoAlto": {
                        "text": "Disco casi lleno",
                        "color": "red",
                        "index": 3
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.cellOptions",
                "value": {
                  "type": "color-text"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Red"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "ipv4": {
                        "text": "IPv4",
                        "color": "text",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "ipv6": {
                        "text": "IPv6",
                        "color": "text",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Si algo está en rojo",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "1. En **Qué está fallando** se ve cuál servicio falla y en qué equipo.\n2. Si no responde un equipo entero (clinica01 o comunidad01), en kit01 se revisa que esté encendido con `virsh list --all`.\n3. Si falla un servicio, en su equipo se revisa con `systemctl status <servicio>` o `docker compose ps`. El detalle está en la guía de operación y en `observability/prometheus/README.md`."
      }
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
